Functional Requirements
1. The system shall allow users to register and log in.
2. The system shall allow end users to submit bug reports.
3. The system shall allow end users to view and track their bug reports.
4. The system shall allow end users to edit and delete their own reports.
5. The system shall allow developers to view and investigate bug reports.
6. The system shall allow developers to update bug status. 
7. The system shall allow administrators to manage user accounts.
8. The system shall allow administartors to assign bug reports to developers. 
9. The system shall allow administrators to monitor all bug reports.
